      "title": "Ruby flaw ruby2shell, AI agent attack, VMware critical bugs",
      "description": "A critical Ruby flaw called ruby2shell reaches default Rails and Sinatra apps, and Amazon reports AI agents that found and exploited a zero-day on a university server. Also covered: VMware and KVM flaws, a Bell Canada breach, a European Commission cyberattack, WhatsApp fixes and a Windows 11 passkey error.",
      "show_notes_html": "<p>A critical Ruby flaw called ruby2shell reaches default Rails and Sinatra apps, and Amazon reports AI agents that found and exploited a zero-day on a university server. Also covered: VMware and KVM flaws, a Bell Canada breach, a European Commission cyberattack, WhatsApp fixes and a Windows 11 passkey error.</p><p>Stories covered:</p><ul><li>Critical Ruby flaw ruby2shell hits default Rails apps &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://blog.cloudflare.com/ruby2shell-waf-protection/\">Cloudflare Blog</a></li><li>AI agents find and exploit zero-day on university server &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/security/2026/11/20/china-attackers-deployed-ai-agents-that-autonomously-found-and-exploited-a-0-day-to-take-over-a-university-server/5311382\">The Register Security</a>, <a href=\"https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/hackers-use-autonomous-ai-tool-cairn-to-find-zero-day-take-over-server/\">BleepingComputer</a>, <a href=\"https://therecord.media/amazon-research-cairn-ai-university-attacks-possible-zero-day\">The Record</a></li><li>VMware critical bugs and a KVM nested virtualization flaw &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/security/2026/11/20/flaws-in-vmware-and-kvm-need-attention-if-you-have-time-while-fixing-java-php-and-everything-else/5311193\">The Register Security</a></li><li>Bell Canada says agentic attacker stole customer data &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/bell-canada-says-agentic-hacker-stole-enterprise-customer-data/\">BleepingComputer</a></li><li>European Commission confirms AI-driven cyberattack &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/11/20/european-commission-ai-generated-cyberattack-publicly-available-tool/\">Help Net Security</a></li><li>WhatsApp patches three flaws, one tied to scams &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/whatsapp-patches-3-security-flaws.html\">The Hacker News</a>, <a href=\"http