      "date": "2026-11-20",
      "title": "VMware vCenter zero-day, plus critical PHP and NGINX patches",
      "description": "A China-linked group exploited a VMware vCenter flaw before Broadcom released a patch. PHP and F5 NGINX both shipped critical fixes, and ASUS patched its management console. The episode also covers vendor breaches at Chase, Visa and Mastercard, Meta's Muse agent, and Android developer verification.",
      "show_notes_html": "<p>A China-linked group exploited a VMware vCenter flaw before Broadcom released a patch. PHP and F5 NGINX both shipped critical fixes, and ASUS patched its management console. The episode also covers vendor breaches at Chase, Visa and Mastercard, Meta&#x27;s Muse agent, and Android developer verification.</p><p>Stories covered:</p><ul><li>China-linked group exploited VMware vCenter zero-day &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://www.securityweek.com/newly-patched-vmware-vcenter-flaw-exploited-as-zero-day-by-chinese-apt/\">SecurityWeek</a></li><li>PHP November release fixes seven critical flaws &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://www.darkreading.com/application-security/critical-php-flaws-code-execution-panic-php2shell\">Dark Reading</a>, <a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/patches/2026/11/18/another-critical-php-security-release-has-dropped/5310911\">The Register Security</a></li><li>F5 patches five critical NGINX flaws called NGINX2Root &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/11/19/nginx2root-nginx-vulnerabilities/\">Help Net Security</a>, <a href=\"https://www.docker.com/blog/docker-patches-java4shell-and-the-nginx-http-2-with-docker-hardened-images/\">Docker Blog</a></li><li>ASUS fixes critical flaws in Control Center Express &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/asus-warns-of-critical-hard-coded-key-flaw-in-control-center-express/\">BleepingComputer</a></li><li>Chase, Visa and Mastercard confirm vendor breaches &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://thenextweb.com/news/jpmorgan-chase-visa-mastercard-vendor-breach-n0n-leak\">The Next Web</a>, <a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/security/2026/11/19/chase-visa-mastercard-confirm-third-party-cyberattacks-that-may-have-exposed-customers-info/5311175\">The Register Security</a>, <a href=\"https://databreaches.net/2026/11/19/visa-mastercard-and-jpmorgan-customer-data-leaked-by-hackers/\">DataBreaches.net</a></li><li>Meta employees say AI agent Muse mixes up user data &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/19/metas-ai-agent-muse-is-mixing-up-conversations-and-exposing-private-data-report-says/\">TechCrunch</a></li><li>Android developer verification goes global in January 2027 &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/11/20/android-developer-verification-power-users/\">Help Net Security</a>, <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/gadgets/2026/11/google-will-launch-android-app-verification-requirement-globally-in-january-2027/\">Ars Technica</a></li></ul>",
