    {
      "date": "2026-11-19",
      "title": "Microsoft AI package hijacked, NGINX flaw, PHP patch due Thursday",
      "description": "A Microsoft agent framework package on PyPI was hijacked to steal credentials, and a ten-year-old NGINX flaw can allow code execution. PHP has another critical release due Thursday, and F5 disclosed six critical BIG-IP flaws. Also covered are Gemini 4 Neon, banks shifting AI agent risk to customers, and an Irish credit union data breach.",
      "show_notes_html": "<p>A Microsoft agent framework package on PyPI was hijacked to steal credentials, and a ten-year-old NGINX flaw can allow code execution. PHP has another critical release due Thursday, and F5 disclosed six critical BIG-IP flaws. Also covered are Gemini 4 Neon, banks shifting AI agent risk to customers, and an Irish credit union data breach.</p><p>Stories covered:</p><ul><li>Microsoft Agent Framework PyPI package compromised &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/microsofts-agent-framework-pypi-package-compromised-to-steal-credentials/\">BleepingComputer</a>, <a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/security/2026/11/18/microsofts-official-python-agent-framework-hijacked-to-distribute-malware/5310858\">The Register Security</a></li><li>Decade-old NGINX HTTP/2 flaw allows remote code execution &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/10-year-old-nginx-http2-flaw-lets.html\">The Hacker News</a>, <a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/security/2026/11/18/ai-found-more-critical-bugs-in-another-widely-used-technology-running-225m-websites/5310887\">The Register Security</a>, <a href=\"https://isc.sans.edu/diary/rss/33532\">SANS Internet Storm Center</a></li><li>Another critical PHP security release due Thursday &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/patches/2026/11/18/get-ready-for-another-critical-php-security-release-to-drop/5310911\">The Register Security</a></li><li>F5 discloses six critical BIG-IP flaws &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/f5-warns-6-critical-big-ip-flaws-can.html\">The Hacker News</a></li><li>Gemini 4 Neon rolls out, now in GitHub Copilot &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/gemini-models/introducing-gemini-4-neon/\">Hacker News</a>, <a href=\"https://www.techmeme.com/261118/p44#a261118p44\">Techmeme</a></li><li>Banks tell customers AI agent risk is theirs &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/18/more-banks-says-customers-using-ai-agents-are-on-their-own-even-if-they-get-hacked/\">TechCrunch</a></li><li>Wellington IT hack exposes Irish credit union data &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/data-breach-impacts-40-irish-credit-unions-in-reported-it-provider-hack/\">BleepingComputer</a></li></ul>",
